{
  "isoCode": "LA",
  "title": "ເພງຊາດລາວ",
  "language": {
    "code": "lo",
    "name": "Lao",
    "script": "Other"
  },
  "sources": {
    "local": {
      "licence": "Public domain",
      "note": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lao_National_Anthem"
    },
    "english": {
      "author": "English Wikipedia contributors",
      "licence": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "note": "Extracted from the English Wikipedia article cited in sources.local.note."
    }
  },
  "verses": [
    {
      "local": [
        "ຊາດລາວຕັ້ງແຕ່ໃດມາ",
        "[[ລາວທ]]ຸກທົ່ວໜ້າເຊີດຊູສຸດໃຈ",
        "ຮ່ວມແຮງຮ່ວມຈິດຮ່ວມໃຈ",
        "ສາມັກຄີກັນເປັນກຳລັງດຽວ"
      ],
      "english": [
        "For all time, the [[Lao]] folk",
        "have glorified their motherland.",
        "United in heart –",
        "spirit and vigour as one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "local": [
        "ເດັດດ່ຽວພ້ອມກັນກ້າວໜ້າ",
        "ບູຊາຊູກຽດຂອງລາວ",
        "ສົ່ງເສີມໃຊ້ສິດເປັນເຈົ້າ",
        "[[ລາວທ]]ຸກຊົນເຜົ່າສະເໝີພາບກັນ"
      ],
      "english": [
        "Determined to move forward,",
        "upholding the [[Laotians']] grace.",
        "Proclaiming their right to sovereignty,",
        "equal are [[Laotians]] of every race."
      ]
    },
    {
      "local": [
        "ບໍ່ໃຫ້ພວກຈັກກະພັດ",
        "ແລະພວກຂາຍຊາດເຂົ້າມາລົບກວນ",
        "[[ລາວທ]]ັງມວນຊູເອກະລາດ",
        "ອິດສະຫຼະພາບຂອງຊາດລາວໄວ້"
      ],
      "english": [
        "No more shall imperialists",
        "and traitors trample them.",
        "Every [[Lao]] shall defend",
        "the independence of [[Laos]]."
      ]
    },
    {
      "local": [
        "ຕັດສິນໃຈສູ້ຊີງເອົາໄຊ",
        "ພາຊາດກ້າວໄປສູ່ຄວາມວັດທະນາ"
      ],
      "english": [
        "They'll battle for victory,",
        "and lead the nation to prosperity."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
